      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melvina%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Charles A. Hunt named the settlement Melvina after his recently deceased wife, Amanda Melvina Hunt.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melvina%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The early development of Melvina began when Charles A. Hunt built a mill and persuaded other families to settle there.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
